        "title": "张: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "张 counts flat objects such as sheets and tables. Learn the noun's compatible classifier rather than using 张 for every object.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这里有一张桌子。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ yǒu yī zhāng zhuōzi 。",
                "meaning": "There is one table here.",
                "audio": "252fce19f78443a261b1fa78061bc4917fb654af68287e34aee068e88e159d2f"
              },
              {
                "text": "那里有两张桌子。",
                "pinyin": "nàlǐ yǒu liǎng zhāng zhuōzi 。",
                "meaning": "There are two tables there.",
